WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.250
Done looks like this.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:05.150
The check runs on current exports
with the reviewed alias list.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.033
Every Finding has a decision,
which system owns the attribute,

4
00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:11.012
with the other mapping removed.

5
00:00:11.012 --> 00:00:15.450
Every Warning is understood, so
each first value has one source.

6
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.088
The directory name
matches the job's schema.

7
00:00:18.088 --> 00:00:21.299
The two export identities
hold only their reads.

8
00:00:21.299 --> 00:00:22.713
And the tests pass.

9
00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:27.573
That completes the workbook: the typed
task, two least-privilege clients,

10
00:00:27.573 --> 00:00:31.300
three builds, the evidence,
and one writer per attribute.

11
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.450
Thanks for watching.
